{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_bibeak_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_bibeak_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"走出那条长长的走廊","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bibeak_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"c4b8e0b8fb14a7fc8f58a7d612643fbf4564be29964555dd429ea5477641c22d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！怎么回事......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙老师，还好吗？是茶杯烫到你了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯~小柏喙肯定是马上就要回家太开心了，连杯子都拿不稳啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"没事~我听说过炎国的一句老话，“碎碎”平安~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，别担心，这场茶话会就是为了给你回家送行才办的，你在这里坐着就好，我去给你倒一杯新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，请小心一点！我先把这里打扫了，你再去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......已经关进去一年多了，爸爸妈妈才告诉我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（其实他们不用这么担心的，我已经......我已经不在乎了......嗯。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（随信来的还有妈妈拍的照片......噗，爸爸的新眼镜，怎么是这个颜色？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（妈妈是故意的吧......嘿嘿。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这些是......给我寄的衣服？还有这把细剑，真好看，也很顺手——是爸爸设计的吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"信使都快把你的这间小屋子堆满了，你父母这是给你寄来了一个小家啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这把剑，我猜你已经决定好了，待会儿训练就用它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这是爸爸给我设计的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"真羡慕呀，之前在家里，你父母也很宠你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梓兰姐，没有啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"你害羞啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梓兰姐，你再说，我就不帮你做那条裙子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，那可真的是太可怕了！没有柏喙的帮助，我可怎么做新衣服呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梓兰姐！不要再取笑我啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你继续看信，我不打扰你了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙看向桌上的另一封信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是谁寄来的，也没有写自己的名字......寄件人是......“监狱”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“善人小姐，我怀着感激的心情写下这封信，我觉得自己已经得到了心灵上最终的平静，并想将这份平和的喜悦传递给您。”\n“一直以来，我因为用源石伤害了无辜的您而感到无比痛苦，于是我向一位心理医生寻求帮助，他化解了我的心结。”\n“他说，人应有一次原谅自己过错的机会。而我给了自己一次这样的机会，我原谅了自己的过错，我觉得自己现在真的非常平和。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"“善人小姐，我向那位医师询问了您会是怎样的心情。我觉得，您也不能继续陷在仇恨与痛苦之中，无法得到平静。”\n“善人小姐，请听听我的话，我们应当原谅自己，原谅他人，应当放下自己的仇恨，甚至去拥抱我们的仇人，这样才好活出新的人生。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么在愣神，这是谁的信呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那个......那个犯人，当初导致我......的那个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......谁？啊......他说了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说......他感觉自己获得了原谅和平静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梓兰姐，我觉得......这是一件好事，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实这几年......我每天都很忙，有很多事情要做，我几乎快把那件事情忘记了，并不会经常想起它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人也说他......我也不知道他这是和哪位心理医生交流过了，但是他说自己已经获得了心灵上的平静，不再为曾经伤害过我而感到痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，既然我已经快把这件事彻底忘记了，他虽然在监狱，但是也通过他的方式解开了心结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么他出狱后，应该也能很快迎来新生活吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......这样就挺好的。这么久了，这件事也算彻底结束了吧？那么我挺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙突然眼角落下一滴眼泪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我、我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"随后，她的眼泪仿佛不受控制一般，不断地从眼眶涌出，淌了满脸。\n柏喙的脸上满是慌张又莫名的表情。\n她慌张地抬起手想要拭去眼泪，但这样的动作完全是徒劳，泪水仍旧不断地凝聚、滚落，她就这样突然哭成了一个泪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，怎么突然哭了？你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我、我这是怎么了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"给你手绢，快擦擦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，哈哈......我、我也不知道这是怎么了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是、应该是想到能够回家，有些太开心了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......在你面前出丑了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，这算什么？你快去洗洗脸，我去给你倒杯温水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"快去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我这是怎么了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，问到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，下个月罗德岛会驶过哥伦比亚，我会在补给站下去。阿米娅她特别允许我请了两个月的假，让我好好在家休息一阵子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梓兰姐，我打算这次回家好好陪陪爸爸妈妈，也可以和他们一起出去转转。不过我在想，我带点什么东西回去比较好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他国家的特产？还是罗德岛的什么东西？或者是我自己做点什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梓兰姐，我是不是应该提前联络信使寄出去？还是自己带回去更好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么还慌张起来了，时间还早，你可以慢慢准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你的手怎么这么冰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梓兰姐，其实我有点紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为那封信......收到那封信后，这一周我都在想......我想这次回去，我要去一趟监狱。我想去见一下那个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......柏喙呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"能做出这样的决定，你真的很厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有......我也是自己想了一周，才这么决定的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是觉得，我应该要去看看，毕竟，这是我......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，不用紧张。下决心去直接见那个人，也是一种面对过去的方式。你的想法很好，你很勇敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"走，刚才你问的那个回家带什么的问题，我其实也没有什么经验，我们一起去问问其他人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉姐，打扰啦，我下个月要回一趟家，想问问你，回家应该带点什么东西比较好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎国特产醉鳞？嗯......谢谢你，我考虑一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你带的是向古米请教后自己做的饼干？听起来很有趣，我这就去厨房问问！谢谢你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，古米出任务去了？这样啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你带的是出任务时拍的照片，家里人都很喜欢？唔，我想想看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们，我已经有点想法了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（相比于买的东西，家人更喜欢干员们亲手做的礼物。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（其实，只要是和我紧密相关的东西，包含了爱意的东西，就足够了吧？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"几天后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新衣服这就要做好了？不愧是柏喙老师，效率真的好高啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是告诉了你一些基础的编织方法，算不上你的老师啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......这么多天了，我才刚刚裁剪好布料，不知道我什么时候才能给爸爸也做一件衣服呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为初学者，你做得已经很棒了，过不了多久就能做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"小柏喙前几天问了那么多干员回家准备了什么，最终还是决定给爸爸妈妈做衣服了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，大家和我讲了自己回家都带了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是带了乌萨斯的特产蜜饮，或者是自己出任务途中买到的萨米特制熏肉，家人更喜欢的也会是一盒已经被压碎的亲手做的饼干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能自己做的东西里包含了更多情感吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我在裁布的时候才发现自己已经不知道父母最近的衣服尺码了，没办法做一些贴身的衣物，只好做了外套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"外套也很好啊，保暖又好看。不过你下个月才回去呢，不用这么着急，我好几天都看到你在这里熬夜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么......只是最近闲下来就感觉很奇怪，好像是心慌一样，总觉得要一直做点什么事才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是因为你要回家啦，心情激动，大家都是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......也有可能是因为柏喙老师还要去见那个坏人......这样真的没问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直觉得，应该离坏人远远的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我也听说了，我其实有些担心，你见了他，要说些什么啊？万一他写信是骗你的呢？等你真的去了，他又说些不好听的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......应该会没事的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就只是普普通通地去探监，里面有那么多警察看着，还隔着一层玻璃说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这次去不干什么，只是看看他在监狱里过得怎么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然他写了那封信，他还在里面主动找了心理医生，就说明他自己也是想好好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要那个人现在也真的平静下来，准备好好生活，就好了。嗯，我是这样想的，应该没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是你，我就算去，估计也会穿上我最好的衣服，然后告诉他我过得很好，一点也没有被影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，毕竟去的是你自己，那就跟随你自己的想法去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己的想法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨嗨~你们在做什么？我在外面听到了“衣服”两个字哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔有很多酷酷的衣服，我可以帮小柏喙打扮一下~就穿那件有面具的衣服好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟在监狱里，你要震慑住他才行哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你别胡说啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我看到小柏喙刚才笑了哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们帮我想办法啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那，我自己的想法是什么呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，柏喙，你怎么又开始画设计图了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我正在设计一件衣服......给监狱里的那个人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果衣服代表着某种感情，我会为他设计出什么样的衣服？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（黑色的？温暖的？破碎的？舒适的？僵硬的？丑陋的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可，我为什么会想要给他设计一件衣服？这些线条，这些布料，这一针一线，都代表着什么？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......我不知道......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好专心哦，都没有听到你说话哎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙？"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙仍旧没有回答。她埋着头，在纸上不断地勾勒着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，那我先打一个盹好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，其实我有些担心，不知道柏喙的爸爸妈妈会不会陪着她一起去。她要是一个人，还是挺让人担心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，如果柏喙这次去了，也没出什么事，那这件事情就算有一个真正的结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙老师，别画啦别画啦，克洛丝都睡着了。你今天在这里工作了多久了？不要太累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了......手边正好还有一点布......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我把这点做完就好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这么一会儿功夫，你已经开始裁剪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，给你爸爸妈妈的衣服不是已经做好了吗？这件是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙突然停下了手，怔怔地看着自己面前这件已经逐渐成型的黑色外套。\n规整的版型和裁剪下，它的针脚凌乱不堪，布料扎手，包边毛糙。\n她下意识地摸索着拿起了桌面上的剪刀，想要去剪毁这件衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件是我想着那个监狱里的人做的衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬，你居然给他做了件衣服？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯~发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......哇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......我真的很佩服你，柏喙，看来你是真的放下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"居然会给一个伤害了你的人做衣服，你真的很厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我，我做不到这些的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"闲聊的干员站起身，拍了拍柏喙的肩膀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是你，我会搬家，会离开那个地方，再也不会回去，不会去见那个伤害我的人，更不会给他做衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我会恨他一辈子，并且绝对不会原谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我原先只当你是一个坚强勇敢的朋友，但我现在觉得......你值得我敬佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的是很厉害的一个姑娘。"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙张了张嘴，想说什么，但最终没能说出口，只是笑了笑。\n她拿着剪刀的手低垂了下去，呼出一口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你......我不知道我怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么，卡琳，谢谢你这样说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时候不早了，我们都回去休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"小柏喙再见~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，克洛丝，你知道柏喙什么时候走吗？我那天一定要好好送一送她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"要是，能办一个小小的茶话会就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，听起来很有意思哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙老师最近一直在帮我给爸爸做衣服，如果需要改造场地之类的，我......我也可以帮忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"都准备好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"小心~杯子会烫手哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"点心已经摆好了，彩带也准备好了，就等柏喙老师来啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"来了，我把柏喙带过来啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思大家！我收拾行李，有点迟了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸......！我的礼花怎么突然卡住了！稍等稍等——"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘭——！\n围在餐桌四周的干员们拉响了礼花，彩纸散落四周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开始啦，柏喙老师的小小送行会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"来~小柏喙，给你红茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你回家一路平安！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一直以来认真生活、努力工作、为大家制作了数不清的漂亮衣服、在外勤任务上也从不懈怠的小柏喙，祝你回家快乐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，没有没有，大家这样太隆重啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是回一次家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"小柏喙，你今天什么都不用做，在这里享受就好啦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，这几年和你在一块工作，我真的觉得你就像我的一个姐妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去柔柔弱弱的，实际上坚强得很。自己打定了主意，就肯定能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有啦......也是大家帮了我，我没有这么厉害的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，柏喙老师，尝尝点心，这个是厨房刚烤出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食堂阿姨说了，她一想到是为了你这次回家送行，就觉得自己一定要把它做到最好吃才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"来来~小柏喙，我们小小地碰一下杯！不能让芬看到哦，不然她可能会说什么“喝茶没有碰杯”，真的是太坏啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，柏喙，我虽然和你差不多大，但我真的没有你这么勇敢。你现在和当初刚来罗德岛的时候完全不一样了，真的是换了一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，谢谢大家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不说别的，我最佩服你的，还是你甚至能给伤害了你的人也做一件衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"扪心自问，我绝对做不到这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，也没有像你说的那样，我自己也不知道为什么就做了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，这次回去，说不定你就能真的给这件事画上一个完美的句号了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是“以德报怨”吧......我算是理解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“以德报怨”吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，祝你一路顺风！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯！谢谢你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（“以德报怨”......在大家眼里，我是一个以德报怨的人。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我是一个好人，一个善良的人，这个词也是这个意思。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大家喜欢这样的柏喙，敬佩这样的柏喙，为这样的柏喙举办茶话会送行。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在大家看来，我做得很好，我甚至还为伤害我的人做了衣服。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（爸爸妈妈从小教育我，要做一个得体的人，一个知礼的人，所以，我也应当为现在的我感到高兴。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可我真的......高兴吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......我喜欢这样的柏喙吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我喜欢......这样的我吗？）"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙看着大家真心的笑脸，身上好像有一股火烧了起来。\n她突然觉得周围的笑声刺耳，灯光刺眼，茶杯烫手。她觉得自己要打碎点什么。\n她手一抖，杯子掉落在地，她被这响声震得浑身一抖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没人看清那一瞬间发生了什么，等回过神来，碎片和茶水凌乱地崩溅在地面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！怎么回事......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙老师，还好吗？是茶杯烫到你了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯~小柏喙肯定是马上就要回家太开心了，连杯子都拿不稳啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不是的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"没事~我听说过炎国的一句老话，“碎碎”平安~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，别担心，这场茶话会就是为了给你回家送行才办的，你在这里坐着就好，我去给你倒一杯新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，请小心一点！我先把这里打扫了，你再去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是我好像......突然一下，看明白了我自己的内心。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......没事，是我一下子没有拿稳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们继续吧，茶水有没有溅到你们的身上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打扫也让我来吧，我的脚边有不少碎片，自己看得更清楚一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙老师，你没事就好，吓我一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我突然手抖了，没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但我也想明白了，我不喜欢这样的我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我很感谢大家为我办了这个送行会，在这里有和我一起并肩作战的战友，有一起设计制作衣服的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几年是我最宝贵的一段经历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我真的很谢谢大家，谢谢大家真心的祝福。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回家之后一定会这样告诉我的爸爸妈妈：我在这里认识了一群很好的朋友，他们每个人都很体贴、温暖，还为我举办了送行会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我已经......做好我的决定了，并且这一次，我想清楚了，我不会后悔。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，舰船还没有完全停下，我们继续吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，路上小心，回去好好休息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"一路顺风哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路上饿了可以吃点点心，我给你包好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闲聊的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要平平安安的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们，大家再见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我的申请已经提交并且通过，预约探监的时间，是今天下午三点到三点半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请您出示一下申请回执，我核对一下。请稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有问题，请您跟我来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有一些流程需要您完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先在这里签署一下探监须知，刚才的申请回执我已经提交，很快就会有回复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有这份探监人员信息登记，在这里填写您的真实姓名和其他信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最后是这份安全须知，请您在这里阅读。我们去告知犯人做准备，待会儿带您去探监室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。谢谢您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于要到了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"五分钟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"十分钟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"二十分钟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杯中的茶水已经凉透，时间过得仿佛更加缓慢，狱警终于回到这间接待室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流程都已经确认完，最后在安全须知这里再签一个字，您就跟我去探监室吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。多谢您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......善人小姐，您来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您看了我写的信，对吗？您也听了我的话，给了自己一次机会。我们都能放下过去，得到平静！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医师先生说得没错，我应当原谅自己的过错，解开我的心结，我获得了平静，您也是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"善人小姐......我感激您！"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙沉默着递出手上拿的包裹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"善人小姐，您拿的是送给我的东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这是什么......信？我给您寄的信？您怎么拿回来了？"},{"type":"narration","text":"他激动地伸出手，试图挤过窗户的缝隙，触碰柏喙那双正在颤抖的手。\n他也对上了她的眼睛。\n她轻轻地开口，说了一句话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙站起来，转身，准备走出探监室。\n犯人拍打玻璃的声音响在她的身后，随后狱警冲了进来，探监室里只剩下一些破碎的声音。她听不清，也不想听。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙往门外走，走出那条长长的走廊。\n外面阳光很亮。她看着天空，呼出一口气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_124_kroos","aliases":["克洛丝"]},{"speakerId":"char_278_orchid","aliases":["梓兰"]}]}
